20wider%20form%20requires%20the%20existing%20parser%2Fchecker%20to%20check%20the%20complete%20original%20module%20with%20actual%20translated%20import%20signatures.%20Unknown%20bindings%2C%20writes%20or%20evaluation%20are%20never%20omitted.%20New%20atomic%20admission%20additionally%20requires%20ordinary%20synchronous%20hoisted%20named%20function%20declarations%20with%20unique%20actual%20owners%2C%20flat%20checked%20declarations%2C%20complete%20member%20signatures%2C%20and%20matching%20per-member%20target%20mappings.%20Constructor%20errors%20and%20other%20unsupported%20constructs%20remain%20obligations.%20Exact%20empty%20named%20class%20declarations%20with%20no%20inheritance%20or%20members%20are%20inert%20module-form%20facts%20only%3B%20their%20actual%20class%20names%20participate%20in%20ownership%20counts%20while%20class%20translation%20stays%20unsupported.%20Duplicate%20actual%20owners%20refuse%20before%20either%20module-scope%20proof%20route.%20Unknown%20module%20context%20cannot%20certify%20ordinary%2Fpublic%20binding%20signatures%3B%20preserved%20isolated%20item%20outputs%20make%20no%20whole-module%20behavior%20claim.%27%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20for%20%28const%20path%20of%20%5B%27js%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fdata%2Fdeclaration-dependency-rules.lino%27%2C%20%27rust%2Fsrc%2Fdata%2Fdeclaration-dependency-rules.lino%27%5D%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28check%29%20checkProjectData%28new%20URL%28path%2C%20root%29%2C%20policy%29%3B%20else%20writeProjectData%28new%20URL%28path%2C%20root%29%2C%20policy%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20if%20%28native%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20%7B%20parseJavaScript%20%7D%20%3D%20await%20import%28%27..%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fjavascript.js%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20%7B%20checkProgram%20%7D%20%3D%20await%20import%28%27..%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fcheck.js%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20%7B%20emitRust%20%7D%20%3D%20await%20import%28%27..%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Femit-rust.js%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20%7B%20writeRecordRuleLibrary%20%7D%20%3D%20await%20impor