(75280: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20The%20items%20of%20a%20JavaScript%20module%20translated%20into%20Rust%20in%20the%20order%20of%20the%0A%2F%2F%21%20names%20they%20use%2C%20so%20an%20item%20may%20call%20and%20read%20the%20module%27s%20other%20items%20and%0A%2F%2F%21%20the%20items%20it%20imports.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Mirrors%20%60translateBound%60%2C%20%60scanItem%60%20and%20%60declaredSignatures%60%20in%0A%2F%2F%21%20%60js%2Fsrc%2Fself-translation.js%60.%0A%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3A%7BBTreeMap%2C%20HashMap%2C%20HashSet%7D%3B%0A%0Amod%20dependency_rules%3B%0Amod%20recursive_groups%3B%0A%0Ause%20super%3A%3A%7BContext%2C%20Group%2C%20GroupKind%2C%20Translated%2C%20translate_group%7D%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Adecorators%3A%3ADecoratorSet%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3ALanguage%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Air%3A%3A%7BDecl%2C%20Effect%2C%20Node%2C%20Program%7D%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Ajavascript%3A%3AModuleContext%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Alexer%3A%3A%7BToken%2C%20TokenKind%2C%20tokenize%7D%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Asurface%3A%3A%7BExternal%2C%20ExternalParam%7D%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Atypes%3A%3AType%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20A%20named%20import%20an%20item%20makes%3A%20its%20specifier%20and%20the%20imported%20and%20bound%20names.%0A%23%5Bderive%28Clone%29%5D%0Astruct%20ImportScan%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20specifier%3A%20String%2C%0A%20%20%20%20names%3A%20Vec%3C%28String%2C%20String%29%3E%2C%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20What%20a%20JavaScript%20item%20declares%20and%20names%2C%20read%20from%20its%20tokens.%0A%23%5Bderive%28Clone%29%5D%0Apub%28super%29%20struct%20Scan%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20declares%3A%20Option%3CString%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20exported%3A%20bool%2C%0A%20%20%20%20is_async%3A%20bool%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20Ordinary%20is%20the%20actual%20named%20declaration%20branch%20together%20with%20%21is_async.%0A%20%20%20%20function_declaration%3A%20bool%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20Actual%20UTF-16%20class%20and%20name%20ranges%2C%20present%20only%20for%20the%20exact%20empty%20form.%0A%20%20%20%20empty_class_declaration%3A%20Option%3C%5Busize%3B%204%5D%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20mentions%3A%20Vec%3CString%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20imports%3A%20Option%3CImportScan%3E%2C%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20What%20a%20JavaScript%20item%20declares%20and%20names%2C%20read%20from%20its%20tokens%3A%20the%20name%0A%2F%2F%2F%20of%20the%20function%20or%20constant%20it%20declares%2C%20whether%20it%20is%20exported%20or%20async%2C%0A%2F%2F%2F%20the%20identifiers%20it%20mentions%2C%20and%20the%20specifier%20and%20names%20of%20a%20named%20import.%0A%2F%2F%2F%20%60None%60%20when%20the%20item%20does%20not%20tokenize.%0Afn%20scan_item%28text%3A%20%26str%29%20-%3E%20Option%3CScan%3E%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20tokens%20%3D%20tokenize%28text%2C%20Language%3A%3AJavaScript%29.ok%28%29%3F.tokens%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20at%20%3D%20%7Cindex%3A%20usize%7C%20tokens.get%28index%29.or_else%28%7C%7C%20tokens.last%28%29%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20kind%20%3D%20%7Cindex%3A%20usize%2C%20kind%3A%20TokenKind%7C%20at%28index%29.is_some_and%28%7Ctoken%7C%20token.kind%20%3D%3D%20kind%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20value%20%3D%20%7Cindex%3A%20usize%2C%20value%3A%20%26str%7C%20at%28index%29.is_some_and%28%7Ctoken%7C%20token.value%20%3D%3D%20value%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20word%20%3D%20%7Cindex%3A%20usize%2C%20text%3A%20%26str%7C%20kind%28index%2C%20TokenKind%3A%3AIdentifier%29%20%26%26%20value%28index%2C%20text%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20name%20%3D%20%7Cindex%3A%20usize%7C%20at%28index%29.map_or_else%28String%3A%3Anew%2C%20%7Ctoken%7C%20token.value.clone%28%29%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20exported%20%3D%20word%280%2C%20%22export%22%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20mut%20index%20%3D%20usize%3A%3Afrom%28exported%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20mut%20declares%20%3D%20None%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20mut%20is_async%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20mut%20function_declaration%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%20%2