ked%20external%20owners%20reserve%20target%20names%2C%20the%20same%20shared%20normally%20generated%20binding%2Fcall%20decisions%20render%20those%20existing%20calls%20and%20function%20references%2C%20and%20ordinary%20declarations%20keep%20their%20old%20path.%20An%20exact964-byte%20diff%20and%20complete%20inverse%20restore%20every%20prior%20provider%20byte.%20Old%20overlays%2Fdecorator%20actions%20and%20all%20ownership%2Fdescriptor%2Fcertificate%2FLinkId%20gates%20remain%20unchanged.%20Current%20standalone%2Flinked%2Fnative%20behavior%20still%20requires%20its%20independent%20tests%3B%20source%20review%20is%20no%20runtime%20proof.%27%2C%0A%20%20%5D%3B%0A%20%20const%20profiles%3Drevisions.map%28%28revision%2Cindex%29%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20providers%3D%5B%5D%2Cinverse%3D%5B%5D%2Ccertificates%3D%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20for%28const%5Bowner%2Cmodule%5Dof%20modules.entries%28%29%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20file%3D%27js%2Fsrc%2F%27%2Bmodule%2Cold%3Dcapture%28predecessor%2Cfile%29%2Ccurrent%3Dcapture%28revision%2Cfile%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20if%28index%3D%3D%3D1%29%7Bassert.equal%28current.sha256%2CcurrentHashes%5Bowner%5D%2C%27the%20complete%20reviewed%20current%20provider%27%29%3Bassert.equal%28readFileSync%28new%20URL%28file%2Croot%29%2C%27utf8%27%29%2Ccurrent.source%2C%27current%20bytes%20must%20belong%20to%20the%20real%20provider%20checkpoint%27%29%3B%7D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20providers.push%28%7Bmodule%2CsourceSha256%3Acurrent.sha256%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20certificates.push%28%7Bmodule%2Ccurrent%3A%7Brevision%2Csource%3Acurrent.source%2Ccertificate%3Acurrent.certificate%7D%2Cprevious%3A%7Brevision%3Apredecessor%2Csource%3Aold.source%2Ccertificate%3Aold.certificate%7D%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20if%28current.source%21%3D%3Dold.source%29inverse.push%28%7Bmodule%2Cfrom%3Acurrent.source%2Cto%3Aold.source%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%20%20assert.deepEqual%28inverse.map%28row%3D%3Erow.module%29%2Cindex%3D%3D%3D0%3F%5B%27typed-program-links-validation.js%27%5D%3A%5B%27translation%2Femit-javascript.js%27%5D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20profile%3D%7BsourceCommit%3Arevision%2CpreviousSourceCommit%3Apredecessor%2Creview%3Areviews%5Bindex%5D%2Cproviders%2Cinverse%2Ccertificates%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20predecessor%3Drevision%3Breturn%20profile%3B%0A%20%20%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20historicalOutputs%3D%5BpolicyFile%2C...receipts%5D.map%28file%3D%3Ecapture%28revisions%5B0%5D%2Cfile%29%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20host%3Dcapture%28revisions%5B0%5D%2ChostFile%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.deepEqual%28pin%28host.source%29%2C%7Bbytes%3A44535%2Csha256%3A%27b7ba37681c9c057163884d5b73e51bb1a918bafe542bf7cf7450fdfb5d2aa23d%27%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20packet%3D%7BschemaVersion%3A1%2Cmodel%3A%27reviewed%20complete%20overlay%20provider%20succession%201%27%2CpreviousSourceCommit%3Aprevious%2Cprofiles%2ChistoricalOutputs%2Chost%2C%0A%20%20%20%20boundary%3A%27Append%20two%20independently%20committed%20complete%20source%20profiles%20and%20retain%20every%20original%20policy%2C%20overlay%20document%2C%20decorator%20action%2C%20source%20body%20and%20receipt%20byte.%20Current%20source%20identities%20and%20complete%20inverses%20establish%20source%20succession%20only%3B%20changed%20validation%20and%20external-emission%20behavior%20retain%20separate%20tests%20and%20CI%20execution%20requirements.%20Unknown%20providers%20remain%20refused%20by%20the%20unchanged%20exact%20five-hash%20selector.%27%7D%3B%0A%20%20let%20registered%3Dhost.source%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%7Bfrom%2Cto%7Dof%20hostEdits%29%7Bassert.equal%28registered.split%28from%29.length%2C2%29%3Bregistered%3Dregistered.replace%28from%2C%28%29%3D%3Eto%29%3B%7D%0A%20%20let%20inverse%3Dregistered%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%7Bfrom%2Cto%7Dof%20hostEdits.toReversed%28%29%29%7Bassert.equal%28inverse.split%28to%29.length%2C2%29%3Binverse%3Dinverse.replace%28to%2C%28%29%3D%3Efrom%29%3B%7D%0A%20%20assert.equal%28inverse%2Chost.source%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20hostPath%3Dnew%20URL%28hostFile%2Croot%29%2CactualHost%3DreadFileSyn