rAlias%3Dproof.sources.find%28row%3D%3Erow.file%3D%3D%3Dpolicy.sourcePaths%5B1%5D%29%3D%3D%3Dproof.sourceHistory.current%3B%0A%20%20const%20packet%3D%7BschemaVersion%3Apolicy.schemaVersion%2Cmodel%3Apolicy.model%2Crevision%3Apolicy.revision%2Cartifact%2Cregister%2Cloan%2Csources%2Cadapters%2CinferenceDescriptorAlias%2Cedge%3Anull%2C%0A%20%20%20%20boundary%3A%27One%20additive%20provenance%20edge%20updates%20three%20actual%20source%20descriptors%20and%20both%20logical%20inference-proof%20descriptor%20paths.%20Complete%20emitted%20definitions%2C%20archives%2C%20fixtures%2C%20mappings%2C%20prior%20receipts%20and%20policies%20retain%20exact%20whole-byte%20inverses.%20This%20supplies%20no%20semantic-equivalence%20or%20native-execution%20evidence.%27%7D%3B%0A%20%20const%20result%3DderiveCurrentOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorOutputs%28packet%29%3Bpacket.edge%3Dresult.edge%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20row%20of%5Bartifact%2Cregister%2Cloan%5D%29row.current%3Dpin%28result.outputs.find%28output%3D%3Eoutput.file%3D%3D%3Drow.file%29.source%29%3B%0A%20%20verifyCurrentOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorRefresh%28packet%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20writes%3D%5B...result.outputs.map%28row%3D%3E%28%7B...row%2Cprevious%3A%5Bartifact%2Cregister%2Cloan%5D.find%28input%3D%3Einput.file%3D%3D%3Drow.file%29.sourceText%7D%29%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20...adapters.map%28row%3D%3E%28%7Bfile%3Arow.file%2Csource%3AderiveCurrentOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorSource%28row%29%2Cprevious%3Arow.sourceText%7D%29%29%5D%3B%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20Validate%20every%20input%20before%20the%20first%20write%2C%20and%20keep%20repeated%20authors%20exact.%0A%20%20for%28const%20row%20of%20writes%29%7Bconst%20actual%3DreadFileSync%28new%20URL%28row.file%2Croot%29%2C%27utf8%27%29%3Bassert.ok%28actual%3D%3D%3Drow.previous%7C%7Cactual%3D%3D%3Drow.source%7C%7CacceptCurrentRawPredecessorOutput%28actual%2Crow.file%29%2C%27unreviewed%20whole%20input%3A%20%27%2Brow.file%29%3Bif%28check%29assert.equal%28actual%2Crow.source%29%3B%7D%0A%20%20const%20helperPath%3Dnew%20URL%28