argets.alias%2Cchanges%7D%3B%0A%20%20const%20register%3DreadStructuredDataLino%28packet.register.sourceText%29%3Bassert.equal%28Object.hasOwn%28register%2Cproperty%29%2Cfalse%29%3B%0A%20%20register%5Bproperty%5D%3D%5Bedge%5D%3Bconst%20registerText%3DserializeProjectData%28register%2CregisterFile%29%3B%0A%20%20delete%20register%5Bproperty%5D%3Bassert.equal%28serializeProjectData%28register%2CregisterFile%29%2Cpacket.register.sourceText%2C%27all%20older%20register%20edges%20survive%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20loan%3DreadStructuredDataLino%28packet.loan.sourceText%29%2Cprevious%3DstructuredClone%28loan.predecessor%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.deepEqual%28%7Bbytes%3Aprevious.bytes%2Csha256%3Aprevious.sha256%7D%2Cedge.previous%29%3B%0A%20%20Object.assign%28loan.predecessor%2Cedge.current%29%3Bconst%20loanText%3DserializeProjectData%28loan%2CloanFile%29%3B%0A%20%20loan.predecessor%3Dprevious%3Bassert.equal%28serializeProjectData%28loan%2CloanFile%29%2Cpacket.loan.sourceText%2C%27the%20entire%20borrowed%20receipt%20survives%27%29%3B%0A%20%20return%7Bedge%2Coutputs%3A%5B%7Bfile%3AartifactFile%2Csource%3AartifactText%7D%2C%7Bfile%3AregisterFile%2Csource%3AregisterText%7D%2C%7Bfile%3AloanFile%2Csource%3AloanText%7D%5D%7D%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Aexport%20function%20verifyCurrentOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorPacket%28packet%29%7B%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20Only%20the%20initial%20normal%20author%20has%20no%20successor%20packet%20yet.%20Installed%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20readers%20never%20admit%20PENDING%20%28load%20independently%20checks%20the%20whole%20digest%29.%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20A%20later%20caller%20cannot%20coherently%20replace%20current%20pins%20or%20source%20intervals.%0A%20%20if%28policySha256%21%3D%3D%27PENDING%27%29assert.equal%28pin%28serializeProjectData%28packet%2Coutput%29%29.sha256%2CpolicySha256%2C%27the%20entire%20reviewed%20current%20packet%20stays%20exact%27%29%3B%0A%20%20exactKeys%28packet%2C%5B%27schemaVersion%27%2C%27model%27%2C%27revision%27%2C%27artifact%27%2C%27register%27%2C%27loan%27%2C%27sources%2