(115763: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20JavaScript%20frontend%20for%20the%20portable%20core.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20It%20reads%20the%20subset%20of%20modern%20JavaScript%20the%20core%20can%20represent%0A%2F%2F%21%20faithfully%3A%20Number%20and%20%60BigInt%60%20arithmetic%2C%20strings%20and%20booleans%3B%20top-level%20functions%0A%2F%2F%21%20and%20object-literal%20namespaces%20of%20methods%20whose%20types%20come%20from%20%60JSDoc%60%0A%2F%2F%21%20%28%60%40param%60%2C%20%60%40returns%60%2C%20and%20%60%40typedef%60%20unions%20of%20%60%7B%20%24%3A%20%27tag%27%2C%20%E2%80%A6%20%7D%60%20object%0A%2F%2F%21%20types%20for%20data%20types%29%20or%2C%20where%20%60JSDoc%60%20is%20silent%2C%20are%20inferred%20from%20how%20the%0A%2F%2F%21%20program%20uses%20them%3B%20bodies%20made%20of%20%60const%60%2C%20%60if%60%2C%20%60return%60%2C%20%60throw%60%20and%0A%2F%2F%21%20%60switch%60%20statements%3B%20and%20a%20top%20level%20of%20%60console.log%60%2C%20%60const%60%20and%0A%2F%2F%21%20%60node%3Aassert%60%20statements%2C%20which%20are%20the%20program%27s%20effects.%20A%20function%0A%2F%2F%21%20whose%20leading%20statements%20throw%20on%20a%20negative%20argument%20takes%20a%20natural%0A%2F%2F%21%20number.%20Everything%20else%20is%20rejected%20with%20a%20precise%20obligation.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Mirrors%20%60js%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fjavascript.js%60.%0A%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3A%7BHashMap%2C%20HashSet%7D%3B%0A%0Ause%20super%3A%3Adiagnostics%3A%3A%7BResult%2C%20TranslationError%2C%20type_error%2C%20unsupported%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Ajavascript_line_terminator_rules%3A%3Aaccept_java_script_line_terminator%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Alexer%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20Comment%2C%20Source%2C%20Token%2C%20TokenCursor%2C%20TokenKind%2C%20describe%2C%20is_js_space%2C%20tokenize%2C%0A%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Asurface%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20BinaryOp%2C%20External%2C%20Guard%2C%20SArrayItem%2C%20SComparison%2C%20SCtor%2C%20SData%2C%20SEffect%2C%20SExpr%2C